  "description": "Kim Seunghyun works in the post-incident response unit of Special Esper Crime Task Force Team 1. His daily life is nothing but stress thanks to his assignment: managing Seo Rahel, an unhinged esper agent so troublesome that even the government has given up on him.\n\nOne night, while cleaning up Rahel’s latest disaster and working overtime until he gets a nosebleed, Seunghyun is suddenly kidnapped by unknown assailants… and wakes up to find himself locked in the same room as Rahel.\n\nHis body burns as if reacting to an unknown poison, Rahel insists his own powers have been sealed, and a cult-like group has left behind a note that says they can only escape if they have sex.\n\nCan Seunghyun make it out safely—or will he be dragged even deeper into Rahel’s chaos?\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Welcometo)\n\n**Official Translations:**      \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/welcometo), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.jp/comic/welcometo)",
